## Copy this file to `local.properties` and adjust the path.
## local.properties is NOT committed — it is git-ignored.
##
## Points to the Android SDK installation on your dev machine.
## On macOS: ~/Library/Android/sdk
## On Linux: /home/<user>/Android/Sdk
## On Windows: C\:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk

sdk.dir=/home/your-user/Android/Sdk
